  "html": "<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-LmUA_sFz_Gs/YF-M_2RwluI/AAAAAAABIf0/YjesKMFzjm8sf77OHWMqCJV9Lr9SRYWQACPcBGAsYHg/s2387/IMG_20210327_213102%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-LmUA_sFz_Gs/YF-M_2RwluI/AAAAAAABIf0/YjesKMFzjm8sf77OHWMqCJV9Lr9SRYWQACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_213102%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table><br><b> Kaina</b>: nedidelė (man dvi porcijos kainavo apie 3 EUR)Laikas: 30-40 min.<br><br><b>Jums reikės:</b><br>2 porcijoms:<br>360 g tofu (natūralaus, beskonio)<br>5 šaukštai miltų (kvietinių, kukurūzų arba ryžių)<br>3 šaukštai cukraus<br>2 šaukštai krakmolo, ištirpinto 3 šaukštuose vandens<br>Žiupsnelis druskos<br><br>Pagardui - veganiškas „jogurtas“.&nbsp;<br><br><b>Paruošimas:</b><br><br>1. Sutrupiname tofu. Tai patogu padaryti dviem šakutėmis.<div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6zMn0koM6HM/YF-M_wTSrVI/AAAAAAABIf0/Jz4Jp8uZ_agD4ciEPAJ5tFOSWETm7-j4ACPcBGAsYHg/s2090/IMG_20210327_205130%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6zMn0koM6HM/YF-M_wTSrVI/AAAAAAABIf0/Jz4Jp8uZ_agD4ciEPAJ5tFOSWETm7-j4ACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_205130%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-AVFMKT8PoAo/YF-M_3EEHcI/AAAAAAABIf0/wy15Zf1tJGUKVJd_kZ-vFlTc2cs2lp8tACPcBGAsYHg/s2448/IMG_20210327_205315%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-AVFMKT8PoAo/YF-M_3EEHcI/AAAAAAABIf0/wy15Zf1tJGUKVJd_kZ-vFlTc2cs2lp8tACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_205315%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Cx-1BTAkA2I/YF-M_43TJ8I/AAAAAAABIf0/Ftd8fyJ5GQgbkyCf9wotKU6ovjwintVKACPcBGAsYHg/s2448/IMG_20210327_205455%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Cx-1BTAkA2I/YF-M_43TJ8I/AAAAAAABIf0/Ftd8fyJ5GQgbkyCf9wotKU6ovjwintVKACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_205455%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>2. Visus ingredientus sudedame į indą ir išmaišome rankomis</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-hRarqQh-BTk/YF-M_5Ejz5I/AAAAAAABIf0/7HW2W7zYcMELFMebxICGz0sEuVrfgJGHQCPcBGAsYHg/s2799/IMG_20210327_210541%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-hRarqQh-BTk/YF-M_5Ejz5I/AAAAAAABIf0/7HW2W7zYcMELFMebxICGz0sEuVrfgJGHQCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_210541%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>3. Ant pjaustymo lentelės beriame šiek tiek miltų, formuojame juosteles, kurias supjaustome.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-hjalb8eEc7c/YF-M_2GNupI/AAAAAAABIf0/1VbrMdhHclMSxjjX-wS6XhXJit8OA4jZACPcBGAsYHg/s3264/IMG_20210327_210934.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-hjalb8eEc7c/YF-M_2GNupI/AAAAAAABIf0/1VbrMdhHclMSxjjX-wS6XhXJit8OA4jZACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_210934.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UQUDG6XD86g/YF-M_4L9FHI/AAAAAAABIf0/pinfYuenEKQiIbV4uGct8pnM-2CYZ4I6gCPcBGAsYHg/s3264/IMG_20210327_211143.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UQUDG6XD86g/YF-M_4L9FHI/AAAAAAABIf0/pinfYuenEKQiIbV4uGct8pnM-2CYZ4I6gCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_211143.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>4. Sudedame į pasūdytą verdantį vandenį. Po kelių minučių kukuliai iškyla, verdame dar 7-10 min.</div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-iI0yppE0gMk/YF-M_6IemQI/AAAAAAABIf0/_Fe0nwyE0OUUYF-Vmw1NCXUMsPI5XIbeQCPcBGAsYHg/s3128/IMG_20210327_211215%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-iI0yppE0gMk/YF-M_6IemQI/AAAAAAABIf0/_Fe0nwyE0OUUYF-Vmw1NCXUMsPI5XIbeQCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_211215%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-H8ATaVBKadc/YF-M_5ka8KI/AAAAAAABIf0/thkc9q3os6QO6DcReydvdD4yl7qBZiObwCPcBGAsYHg/s2200/IMG_20210327_212007%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-H8ATaVBKadc/YF-M_5ka8KI/AAAAAAABIf0/thkc9q3os6QO6DcReydvdD4yl7qBZiObwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_212007%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>5. Patiekiame su veganišku jogurtu.</div><br><br><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-vzZUFJrYyXw/YF-M_47MQxI/AAAAAAABIf0/mPs1dxEFfl0H23cRRliYTVp6wqhNCh5pwCPcBGAsYHg/s2927/IMG_20210327_213102%257E3.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210613081500im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-vzZUFJrYyXw/YF-M_47MQxI/AAAAAAABIf0/mPs1dxEFfl0H23cRRliYTVp6wqhNCh5pwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210327_213102%257E3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr><tr><td>Su bananų-braškių jogurtu</td></tr></tbody></table><br><p></p></div><div>Receptas paimtas iš Instagram kanalo <i>@mano_vaikinas_veganas</i> ir pakeistas pagal savo poreikius bei skonį.</div>",
